# Always push after each change

After finishing a change, commit it (if there is anything to commit) and immediately push to the remote. Do not wait to be asked.

- Use `git push -u origin HEAD` when the branch has no upstream
- Never force-push to `main` or `master`
- Never skip hooks
- Do not push secrets or credential files
